    "body": "@domenic OK, how about this?\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<hgroup>\r\n  <p>Category: <a href=\"/diary\">diary</a> / <a href=\"/diary/2022\">2022</a> / <a href=\"/diary/2022/08\">08</a></p>\r\n  <h1>I went to Niagara Falls.</h1>\r\n  <p>Created at: <time datetime=\"2022-08-12\">2022-08-12</time></p>\r\n</hgroup>\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\n`p` elements is both sides of a `h1` element. Each of them has information about category and created date.",
